cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Cloudra in research, please cite the manuscript below and record the software commit used."
title: "Cloudra: An Autonomous Agent for Organic Small-Molecule Mechanism Computation"
abstract: >-
  An autonomous agent system for organic small-molecule reaction mechanism computation:
  geometric and electronic perception tools, a delivery-evidence DAG with ordered stage
  contracts, and a deterministically audited evaluation harness. Requires a POSIX host
  and an OpenAI-compatible LLM endpoint.
authors:
  - name: "Cloudra Team"
type: software
